msgstr "ステップ 3：STLT による減衰検出"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_advanced_workflow.ipynb:70004
#: 4518befef7ea4bceac212f0ef1245102
msgid ""
"Use Short-Time Laplace Transform to identify decay rates in the seismic "
"signal."
msgstr "Short-Time Laplace Transform を用いて、地震信号の減衰率を特定します。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_advanced_workflow.ipynb:90002
#: 46597be2b9b940bdbea9341098ea1e62
