msgstr "ステップ 5：処理済みデータからの Field 再構成"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_advanced_workflow.ipynb:110004
#: 1cc15cf50a384c9e93f1e5f79dd1ed7a
msgid ""
"After analysis, reconstruct the Field structure to maintain 4D organization."
msgstr "解析後、4次元構造を維持するために Field 構造を再構成します。"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_advanced_workflow.ipynb:130002
#: 95b99a0fe7844f468df8f9c35fd6c637
msgid "Summary: Field × Advanced Analysis Best Practices"
msgstr "まとめ：Field × 高度解析のベストプラクティス"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_advanced_workflow.ipynb:130004
#: 210c583d50954427817d87b8e26ccbb2
msgid "Workflow Pattern"
msgstr "ワークフローパターン"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_advanced_workflow.ipynb:130016
#: 234d8fa324fc4c2fabb21fa9019b715f
msgid "Key Techniques"
msgstr "主要テクニック"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_advanced_workflow.ipynb:130018
#: 74facf0965394eafaf488924b0b30b2c
msgid "**Extraction**: `field[:, x, y, z].to_timeseries()` for point analysis"
msgstr "**抽出**: `field[:, x, y, z].to_timeseries()` でポイント解析"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_advanced_workflow.ipynb:130019
#: 0caeac2a6cda4741b535a1d352421dc1
msgid "**Batch Processing**: Use FieldList for parallel operations"
msgstr "**バッチ処理**: FieldList で並列操作"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_advanced_workflow.ipynb:130020
#: a4a8b56d8b3b4c89bcb6a011bd87979f
msgid ""
"**Transform Cycle**: `fft_time()` → process → `ifft_time()` preserves 4D"
msgstr "**変換サイクル**: `fft_time()` → 処理 → `ifft_time()` で4D構造を保持"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_advanced_workflow.ipynb:130021
#: bfa18a6e5b2b4edc96dd1f6e9e719982
msgid "**Slicing**: Maintain 4D structure even when selecting single indices"
msgstr "**スライシング**: 単一インデックス選択時でも4D構造を維持"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_advanced_workflow.ipynb:130023
#: 8d80dd2bdedc4293bae9c51d3e0b22f8
msgid "When to Use What"
msgstr "手法の使い分け"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_advanced_workflow.ipynb:130025
#: b4d96923b57e47f9849c90a19d73d4c4
msgid "**Point analysis**: Extract TimeSeries, apply HHT/STLT/Wavelet"
msgstr "**ポイント解析**: TimeSeries を抽出し、HHT/STLT/Wavelet を適用"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_advanced_workflow.ipynb:130026
#: f6e54be0496c4928b303fa6ec6763159
msgid "**Spatial patterns**: Use `fft_space()` for k-space analysis"
msgstr "**空間パターン**: `fft_space()` で K空間解析"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_advanced_workflow.ipynb:130027
#: ca3b0a490fcc41e4ab9a0cfd49499dec
msgid "**Batch operations**: FieldList for multiple realizations"
msgstr "**バッチ操作**: FieldList で複数の実現値を処理"

#: ../../how-to/containers/field_advanced_workflow.ipynb:130028
#: 825de6d9aa064140b9d6048057960744
msgid ""
"**Full 4D transforms**: `fft_time()` + `fft_space()` for frequency-"
"wavenumber"
msgstr "**全4D変換**: `fft_time()` + `fft_space()` で周波数-波数解析"
